Krita Nova 08 - Settings > Export Settings... / Import Settings...

Export packs Krita's settings into a zip: kritarc, kritadisplayrc, kritashortcutsrc,
klanguageoverridesrc (config folder) and krita5.xmlgui + input/*.profile (resource
folder), with a krita-settings.json manifest.

Import validates the zip (whitelisted file names only), stages it in the config folder
and applies it at the very beginning of the next start (main()), before anything reads
the configuration, so nothing written while Krita runs or quits overwrites it.
Previous settings are backed up to <config>/krita-settings-backup first. The device's
own ResourceDirectory, RecentFiles and File Dialogs entries are kept.

Core logic (KisSettingsTransferCore) depends only on QtCore + KConfigCore and is unit
tested by tests/settings-transfer (CI workflow tests.yml). KRITA5_XMLGUI_VERSION 546, xmlgui hash updated.

